 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "おぎはら楽天: 花後に花茎を切る程度。RHS: 春に芽が出たら刈る、種が要らなければ秋に花がらを取る。初夏の切り戻し・夏の傷みの記述はないので C ではなく B（機械は C）。こぼれ種は RHS「管理しないと厄介になりうる」、NC State「侵略的とする資料もある（自然地へ広げない）」で、庭ではびこるとの明記とまでは読まず E にしなかった",
  "management_type_quote": "deadhead in autumn if seed is not required",
  "management_type_by_matching": "E 隔離推奨型",
  "heat_west_only": null,
  "muggy_west_only": null,
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or South-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[こぼれ種 3／RHS・品種] potential to become a nuisance due to prolific self-seeding / [NC State・種] It is a weed that spreads by volunteer seedlings（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 2／MBG・種] Plants more freely self-seed where reliably hardy and they have escaped gardens and naturalized in a number of areas.\n[こぼれ種の食い違い] Walters は 1 相当、stauden.de は 1 相当\n[読み直し 2026-11-24] こぼれ種：言い回しの照合では 2、文を読み直して 3（[RHS・品種] potential to become a nuisance due to prolific self-seeding / [NC State・種] It is a weed that spreads by volunteer seedlings）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）\n[NC State・種] Some sources have labeled it \"invasive.\" Do not allow this species to spread into natural areas and become a problem.\n[管理タイプの見直し] 文を読んで隔離推奨型にしなかったので、侵略的 から 強い に下げた",
  "silhouette_evidence": "[NC State・種] Habit/Form: Erect",
